{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"8a51ca1253c1afeb","x":-120,"y":40,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"# Data types"},
		{"id":"1c9639c1e35c0b52","x":320,"y":260,"width":400,"height":460,"type":"text","text":"# File (TEXT)\nEssential operations\n``` pascal\nVAR \n\tF1: TEXT;\n{Reset the index in file,\nprepare for read}\nRESET(F1); \n\n{Delete all text from F1, prepare to write}\nREWRITE(F1); \n\n{Assign F1 to existant file by its name, the file should locate in the same dir that is the script}\nASSIGN(F1, 'name_of_file');\n```"},
		{"id":"dcac44692b04d788","x":-120,"y":-160,"width":160,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"# PASCAL"},
		{"id":"dce98623655e251c","x":320,"y":-420,"width":280,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"# Conditions\n``` pascal\nIF <condition>\nTHEN\n\tBEGIN\n\t\t<body>\n\tEND\n<ELSE IF\n\tBEGIN\n\tEND\n>\n<ELSE\n\tBEGIN\n\tEND\n>\n```"},
		{"id":"ce21dc04e4b2aefe","x":-580,"y":440,"width":620,"height":944,"type":"text","text":"# READ and WRITE\nRead and write one character from/to a file\nRead operation set the value at current index in character variable, then move the index forward\nWrite operation do write a character into the current index, then move the index forward\n\n``` pascal\n{ INPUT = 'ABC' }\nVAR\n\tCh: CHAR;\nWHILE NOT EOLN(INPUT)\nDO\n\tBEGIN\n\t\tREAD(INPUT, Ch);\n\t\tWRITE(OUTPUT, Ch); \n\tEND;\n{ OUTPUT = 'ABC' }\n```\n\n## Table of execution\n{A} - index is pointing at the symbol 'A'\n\n|                       | INPUT  | OUTPUT | Ch  | EOLN |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------ | --- | ---- |\n| WHILE NOT EOLN(INPUT) | {A}BC/ |        | ?   | F    |\n| READ(INPUT, Ch);      | A{B}C/ |        | A   |      |\n| WRITE(OUTPUT, Ch);    |        | A      |     |      |\n| WHILE NOT EOLN(INPUT) |        |        |     | F    |\n| READ(INPUT, Ch);      | AB{C}/ |        | B   |      |\n| WRITE(OUTPUT, Ch);    |        | AB     |     |      |\n| WHILE NOT EOLN(INPUT) |        |        |     | F    |\n| READ(INPUT, Ch);      | ABC{/} |        |     |      |\n| WRITE(OUTPUT, Ch);    |        | ABC    |     |      |\n| WHILE NOT EOLN(INPUT) |        |        |     | Y    |\n\n\n"},
		{"id":"e8fe83f4710d6818","x":-290,"y":200,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"# Character"},
		{"id":"7871ae4811fd1e7c","x":880,"y":340,"width":280,"height":300,"type":"text","text":"# File markers\nEOLN - end of line, situation when the index is pointing at the symbol of the end of line\n`EOLN(F1) {T of F}`\n\nEOF - end of file,  situation when the index is pointing at the symbol of the end of file\n`EOF(F1) {T of F}`"}
	],
